    "created_at": "2016-11-29T05:59:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-29T05:59:21Z",
    "body": "The proposal sounds good. However I wonder if we should also remove the fallback from abort to close, to maintain the idea that the \"v1\" feature set is focused around obvious mappings, and not around convenient cleanup---especially convenient cleanup that only works in one of the many cases.\r\n\r\nAlso we should fix up all the examples to do proper cleanup.",
